msgid ",\n                    à examiner. Il n'entrera ni au PDF ni au courriel tant que personne ne l'a accepté."
msgstr ", for review. It enters neither the PDF nor the email until someone accepts it."

#. module: bf_federation_meeting
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_meeting.view_meeting_agenda_form_federation
msgid ".\n                    Il se lit ici. Pour y ajouter quelque chose, proposez un sujet : il partira chez lui à examiner."
msgstr ". It is read-only here. To add something, propose a topic: it will go to them for review."

#. module: bf_federation_meeting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_meeting/models/meeting_agenda.py:0
