msgstr "<p>At %s, <b>%s</b> proposes the topic \"%s\". It awaits review: it enters neither the PDF nor the email until it is accepted.</p>"

#. module: bf_federation_meeting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_meeting/models/meeting_agenda.py:0
msgid "<p>Ordre du jour reçu de %s. Il se lit ici ; pour y ajouter quelque chose, utilisez <b>Proposer un sujet</b> : il partira chez lui à examiner.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Agenda received from %s. It is read-only here; to add something, use <b>Propose a topic</b>: it will go to them for review.</p>"

